petrus-agenticus-runtime
Copyright 2026 Seasoned

This package is a Haskell port of the Petrus Agenticus runtime hosts
(petrus.agenticus.runtime) from Petrus
(https://github.com/henriquebastos/petrus), pinned under upstream/petrus
(see UPSTREAM.md at the repository root). It reproduces the observable
behaviour of that reference, and its test suite ports the reference's tests
and runs differential checks against it.

Files copied unmodified from the reference and run as they are:
data/pi_helper.mjs, data/pi_application_helper.mjs and
data/pi_model_phase_helper.mjs (upstream src/petrus/agenticus/runtime/), and
data/codex_helper.py (the _HELPER_SOURCE of upstream
src/petrus/agenticus/runtime/codex.py). data/amp_sidecar.py and
data/claude_sidecar.py were written for this package; they call the provider
SDKs the way the reference does.

